      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.973618507385254,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        539.4332885742188,
        239.91468811035156,
        555.8132934570312
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        566.0643310546875,
        527.2117919921875,
        579.2093505859375
      ],
      "text": "The WHO Global TB Programme initiated an update of the current guidelines and commissioned",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        581.5643310546875,
        526.9260864257812,
        594.7093505859375
      ],
      "text": "a systematic review on the use of low complexity automated NAATs for the detection of",
