      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        597.0643310546875,
        509.17620849609375,
        610.2093505859375
      ],
      "text": "resistance to isoniazid and second-line TB drugs in people with signs and symptoms of TB.",
