      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.5682373046875,
        527.01416015625,
        632.7132568359375
      ],
      "text": "The PICO questions were designed to form the basis for the evidence search, retrieval",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.5682373046875,
        133.0819091796875,
        646.7132568359375
      ],
      "text": "and analysis:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        653.3201904296875,
        527.1074829101562,
        666.4652099609375
      ],
      "text": "1.\t Should low complexity automated NAATs be used on sputum in people with signs and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
