      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        684.3201904296875,
        389.1514892578125,
        697.4652099609375
      ],
      "text": "to isoniazid, as compared with culture-based phenotypic DST?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
